WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:03.850
This is legalVector, the desk for your Legal team.

2
00:00:03.850 --> 00:00:07.000
Any department asks Legal through one front door.

3
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:10.300
Drop a Word contract, and the form fills itself.

4
00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:14.750
Before a lawyer opens it, the AI checks every clause against your playbook.

5
00:00:14.750 --> 00:00:18.700
Each finding points at the exact words, and proposes the wording.

6
00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:22.200
Accept it, and it becomes a real Word tracked change.

7
00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:26.200
A failing clause blocks approval, until a lawyer records why.

8
00:00:26.200 --> 00:00:30.200
Notice deadlines and renewals land on one screen, ready for your calendar.

9
00:00:30.400 --> 00:00:38.677
Real product, demo data.
